    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/1aefbc957ca7cd8a4f26198ab671d42a.avif?t=1667988174\" /></div><br>Play as a mysterious traveller whose journey across the world lands you in the kingdom of Zampi. Resolve the drought plaguing the once-prosperous kingdom of Zampi by solving puzzles and destroying the magical pillars blocking the water.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/004103546933b89483bde20e1c1d11db.avif?t=1667988174\" /></div><br>Over the course of your journey, you meet other characters and slowly uncover what exactly happened that led to the downfall of Zampi. The animated cutscenes in the game add to the storyline and keep you wanting for more. Puzzles become more interesting and challenging to solve with different configurations as you proceed further in the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/bdcf22b3914d4c3b59ebfd7b6b3ebe83.poster.avif?t=1667988174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/bdcf22b3914d4c3b59ebfd7b6b3ebe83.webm?t=1667988174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/bdcf22b3914d4c3b59ebfd7b6b3ebe83.mp4?t=1667988174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/a0adcbad9e26baf265bb1889f11d2edf.avif?t=1667988174\" /></div><br>- A game based in the southern part of Ancient India.<br>- 100 simple and unique logical puzzles.<br>- An engrossing mystery surrounding the past, unveils the truth as you 